# Lead form destination — /api/lead tries these in order:

# 1. Resend email (PRIMARY). When RESEND_API_KEY is set, submissions are
#    emailed to LEAD_TO_EMAIL (defaults to info@diamondhomeservice.com if
#    unset), formatted with a reply-to of the homeowner's address.
#    ⚠️ A RESEND_API_KEY must be added in the Vercel env settings or emails
#    will not actually send.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
# LEAD_TO_EMAIL=info@diamondhomeservice.com
#    LEAD_FROM_EMAIL sets the Resend "from" address (must be on a domain
#    verified in Resend). Defaults to
#    "Diamond Home Service Website <leads@diamondhomeservice.com>".
# LEAD_FROM_EMAIL=Diamond Home Service Website <leads@diamondhomeservice.com>

# 2. Webhook alternative (Zapier / Make / CRM webhook, e.g. JobNimbus or
#    AccuLynx inbound webhook) — used only when RESEND_API_KEY is unset.
#    The validated lead JSON is POSTed here.
# LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/XXXX/XXXX/

# If neither is configured, the server logs a prominent warning and the lead
# is only written to the console (dev only — leads are NOT delivered).
